  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello, how are things going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty well, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My gym has a new timetable and I can fit in one class a week. Help me pick.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.26,
   "block": "fitness.opt4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The first one is— oh, sorry, don't comment until I've got through all of them.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instruction_v2_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay.",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 0.29,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "There's spin on Monday evenings, very intense, with loud music and an instructor who shouts a lot.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "block": "fitness.opt4",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "A weights class on Wednesdays where everyone uses barbells, good for strength but it gets crowded.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 3.51,
   "block": "fitness.opt4",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Yoga on Friday lunchtimes, slow and calm, which my tight hamstrings would probably thank me for.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 6.07,
   "block": "fitness.opt4",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Or the Sunday morning swim group, which mixes drills and laps, but means getting up early on the weekend.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 5.56,
   "block": "fitness.opt4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Done. What would you recommend?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "I'd think about what you skip on your own. Most people don't stretch, so yoga fills a gap. The weights class would build strength, though crowds can be annoying. Spin and swimming are both solid cardio choices.",
   "est_sec": 11.57,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "fitness.opt4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, and another thing. What's an emergency fund supposed to cover exactly?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 1.13,
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg17",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
